<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.635 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.635 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.635 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.622 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 7		   Nov 6</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.635		   4.622</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    750,000		 280,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
